  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increasing water productivity for sustainable `nutrition-sensitive` agriculture production and improved food security</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of this project is to strengthen capacities of smallholder farmers for the adoption of sustainable water management and nutrition-sensitive agriculture practices that will in-turn increase their productivity (yields), incomes and nutritional outcomes.</narrative>
